<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 596.7 mln rand SAfrican bonds Mon.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 596.7 mln rand SAfrican bonds Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 596.73 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Monday after buying 88.09 million rand's worth on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
